WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.070
Buy a single share in
a giant company and you

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:04.900
become one of its owners.

3
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.720
But you will never run it.

4
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.120
The owners elect a board,

5
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.910
which appoints managers to run the firm.

6
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.700
Owners can still vote down
pay deals or remove directors.

7
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.760
So surely the owners are in charge?

8
00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.940
When the people who own a company are not

9
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.390
the people who run it,

10
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.190
whose goals win?

11
00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:25.780
In this mission, you'll
map who owns a firm

12
00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:29.610
and who controls it, and meet
the principal and the agent.

13
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:33.590
Then you'll test pay deals meant
to make managers think like owners,

14
00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.600
and see where they go wrong.

15
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.450
Your mission: find out what
happens when the people

16
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.670
in control are not the owners.
